  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。充满爱意打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Bottled Air（瓶装空气）是一个让你能更长时间在水下停留的模组。除了药水和水流装置，你现在可以通过空玻璃瓶吞咽空气来实现这一点。操作非常简单：当气泡条可见时，只需在游泳状态下右键点击空玻璃瓶即可。默认情况下，这将为玩家补充一半的气泡。<br><br>为了防止在此过程中你的背包被水瓶完全填满，你可以将副手持有任意一种“火”类型物品。当前的火类型方块包括<em><strong>营火、火焰弹、熔岩桶和岩浆块</strong></em>。当你持有这些物品之一时，新生成的水瓶会蒸发，你会收回空的玻璃瓶。默认情况下，在这个过程中有 50% 的概率玻璃瓶会破碎。去探索那个水下世界吧！</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的生活质量包中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableWaterConsumptionUnderwater</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家将无法在水下饮用装水的瓶子，以防止获得无限的氧气。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>holdFireTypeItemInOffhandToPreventWaterBottleCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在副手持有火类型方块时防止（蒸发）水瓶的生成。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceGlassBottleBreaksWithFireTypeInOffhand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.5，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当副手物品蒸发水分并归还空（空气）瓶时，玻璃瓶破碎的概率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfAirInBottles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 150，最小值 0，最大值 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">空瓶中包含的空气量。在原版 Minecraft 中，300 是最大空气供应量。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>跳入水中，从空瓶中吞咽空气，以便在水下游泳更长时间：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"518\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>每个玻璃瓶会使气泡条填充一半。在蒸发过程中有 50% 的概率它会破碎：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"518\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>当然，你不必持有火类型方块：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bottled-air/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注和链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中，您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
